/math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of children who preferred cakes swap to ice creams. This implies that <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"162\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>58</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of them continue to prefer cakes.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Writing this information in tabular form, we obtain the following:</p>\n<table rules=\"all\" cellpadding=\"10\" align=\"center\" style=\"border:1px solid black; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 4mm; margin-top: 4mm\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:hidden\"></td>\n<td style=\"border:hidden\"></td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; border-top:hidden; border-right:hidden\">From:</td> \n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border:hidden\"></td>\n<td></td>\n<td width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Ice-creams</b></td>\n<td width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Cakes</b></td> \n</tr>\n<tr> \n<td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; border-left:hidden; border-bottom:hidden\">To:</td>\n<td width=\"80\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Ice-creams</b></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"163\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assi